UMICapture experimental source release

UMICapture is an independently implemented ARKit-based capture and processing
tool developed by Xinrui Xiong. It is inspired by prior open-source work in the
Universal Manipulation Interface, UMI on Legs, iPhUMI, and iPhoneVIO ecosystems.
This acknowledgement describes technical inspiration and compatibility; it
does not imply code derivation, endorsement, or a license grant.

